; FIND outside corner, the front left corner of a block (X- Y- corner).
; Start above the top near the corner, less than step-off #3023 in from
; both faces, within #3020 of the top. Touches the top, then the X face
; (moving +X) and the Y face (moving +Y) at probing depth, and ends over the
; corner at the clearance plane. With #3030 = 0 the active work offset
; gets X0 Y0 at the corner and Z0 at the top. See millgui_outside_corner.
o<probe_front_left_top_corner> sub
o10 if [#<_task> EQ 0]
    o<probe_front_left_top_corner> return
o10 endif
o<millgui_outside_corner> call [-1] [-1]
o<probe_front_left_top_corner> endsub
M2
